{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through the last ten minutes of Juan Fuentes, who has been given the chance to choose his very last words. Captured by Victoriano Huerta's army after the Ten Tragic Days during the Mexican Revolution, Juan will confront his life, death, family, relationships and existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f A short 10 minute narrative experience about reflecting upon your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Choose from a variety of dialogue options. Create your own version of Juan's life, experiences and backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f What will your last words be? Share them with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Art inspired by real-life drawings created during the Mexican Revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda Inspired by the stories of Juan Rulfo and Carlos Fuentes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb6 Released originally in 2023, experience it now in English!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859700?t=1769711722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859700?t=1769711722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859700/8e0097d65e81a905fa6c034f20287cea22ef5872/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769711722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859700/8e0097d65e81a905fa6c034f20287cea22ef5872/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769711722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depiction of violence in a historical setting."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through the last ten minutes of Juan Fuentes, who has been given the chance to choose his very last words. Captured by Victoriano Huerta's army after the Ten Tragic Days during the Mexican Revol